# === Python 核心忽略清單 ===
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# === 虛擬環境 (Virtual Environment) ===
.env
.venv
env/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# === VSCode 設定檔 (可選，建議忽略個人設定) ===
.vscode/

# === 數據檔案 (Data Files) - 避免上傳過大檔案 ===
# 這些是生醫工程常見的數據格式，GitHub 傳不上去且不該公開
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.mat
*.h5
*.pth
*.pkl
*.bdf
*.edf
*.set
*.fdt
*.nii
*.nii.gz

# === 系統暫存檔 ===
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store